# SecureBank DevOps Platform

## Project Overview

SecureBank is a cloud-native banking application deployed using Kubernetes.

The project demonstrates:

- Secure Docker image creation
- Container security scanning
- Image signing
- Kubernetes deployment
- Configuration management
- Secrets management
- CI/CD automation


## Architecture

