## Security Implementation

Implemented:

✔ Non-root Docker user

✔ Minimal secure base image

✔ Vulnerability scanning

✔ Image signing

✔ Kubernetes Secrets

✔ ConfigMaps


## Kubernetes Features

Implemented:

- Deployments
- Services
- ConfigMaps
- Secrets
- Init Containers
- Multi-container Pods


